OL,3,C'I need my beach': Why Jamaica's
OL,4,Cbeaches are off-limits to locals
OL,6,FFor the past year, ITV News Reporter
OL,7,FCree-Summer Haughton has been
OL,8,Finvestigating claims that public
OL,9,Faccess to Jamaica's beaches is
OL,10,Fbecoming increasingly difficult
OL,12,F"I need my beach."
OL,14,FIt's a simple sentence, but I heard it
OL,15,Fagain and again while reporting across
OL,16,FJamaica.
OL,18,FFor months, we had been investigating
OL,19,Fclaims that public access to some of
OL,20,Fthe island's coastline was becoming
OL,21,Fincreasingly difficult.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
