OL,3,C'I need my beach': Why Jamaica's
OL,4,Cbeaches are off-limits to locals
OL,6,FLong before Hurricane Melissa renewed
OL,7,Fattention on Jamaica's shores in
OL,8,FOctober 2025, campaigners were warning
OL,9,Fthat beaches were disappearing behind
OL,10,Fhotel developments, private land and
OL,11,Fpaywalls.
OL,13,FOne place came up more than any other:
OL,14,FBob Marley Beach.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
