OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785358073
OL,3,C'I need my beach': Why Jamaica's
OL,4,Cbeaches are off-limits to locals
OL,6,FFamous for being the reggae legend's
OL,7,Ffavourite stretch of coastline, this
OL,8,Fidyllic spot has been a place for
OL,9,Flocals to surf, fish and gather for
OL,10,Fgenerations. It's also deeply
OL,11,Fconnected to Jamaica's Rastafarian
OL,12,Fcommunity.
OL,14,FBut it has become the focus of a
OL,15,Fdispute after a hotel group started
OL,16,Flobbying the government to build a
OL,17,Fluxury resort here.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30804
