CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785358073
OL,3,C'I need my beach': Why Jamaica's
OL,4,Cbeaches are off-limits to locals
OL,6,FWhile some see tourism development as
OL,7,Fessential to Jamaica's economy, others
OL,8,Fbelieve ordinary people are slowly
OL,9,Flosing access to one of the country's
OL,10,Fgreatest natural resources.
OL,12,FFor many residents, this isn't simply
OL,13,Fabout somewhere to swim.
OL,15,FOne woman, who regularly visits the
OL,16,Fbeach as part of her recovery after
OL,17,Fsurviving cancer, told me she depends
OL,18,Fon it to stay active.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785358073
OL,3,C'I need my beach': Why Jamaica's
OL,4,Cbeaches are off-limits to locals
OL,6,F"I need my beach," she said. "This is
OL,7,Fwhat helped me to walk on my legs. I
OL,8,Fcome here for my exercises."
OL,10,FWhen I asked what would happen if she
OL,11,Fcould no longer access it, her answer
OL,12,Fwas immediate.
OL,14,F"I'd just sit down and vegetate at
OL,15,Fhome. I don't want to vegetate."
OL,17,FShe questioned why they should have to
OL,18,Fpay to reach the sea.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785358073
OL,3,C'I need my beach': Why Jamaica's
OL,4,Cbeaches are off-limits to locals
OL,6,F"Why would I have to pay for free
OL,7,Fwater? This is God's creation," she
OL,8,Ftold me.
OL,10,FAs we travelled around the island,
OL,11,Fcampaigners argued these concerns
OL,12,Fweren't isolated to one community.
OL,14,FJamaica has around 494 miles of
OL,15,Fcoastline, but campaign group JABBEM
OL,16,Fclaims only a tiny proportion is
OL,17,Feasily accessible to locals.
OL,19,FIts chairman, Devon Taylor, believed
OL,20,Fthe issue stretches far beyond
OL,21,Findividual beaches.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785358073
OL,3,C'I need my beach': Why Jamaica's
OL,4,Cbeaches are off-limits to locals
OL,6,F"The people only have access to 2.8
OL,7,Fmiles of coastline," he claimed. "It
OL,8,Freally paints the picture of
OL,9,Flandlessness."
OL,11,FThat is less than 1% of beach space
OL,12,Fthat is free and accessible to locals.
OL,14,FCampaigners also point to Jamaica's
OL,15,FBeach Control Act, legislation
OL,16,Fintroduced in 1956 before the island
OL,17,Fgained independence.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785358073
OL,3,C'I need my beach': Why Jamaica's
OL,4,Cbeaches are off-limits to locals
OL,6,FThey argue it gives too much control
OL,7,Fover the coastline to the government
OL,8,Fand developers, rather than the
OL,9,Fcommunities who have used these
OL,10,Fbeaches for generations.
OL,12,FThe debate has also drawn in one of
OL,13,FJamaica's most recognisable families.
OL,15,FCedella Marley, daughter of reggae
OL,16,Ficon Bob Marley, told me that beaches
OL,17,Fform part of Jamaica's identity.
OL,19,F"Our people deserve better," she said.
OL,20,F"It was given to us by God and now
OL,21,Fit's being taken away by man."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785358073
OL,3,C'I need my beach': Why Jamaica's
OL,4,Cbeaches are off-limits to locals
OL,6,FThe concerns aren't limited to
OL,7,FKingston.
OL,9,FIn western Jamaica, residents are
OL,10,Fopposing proposals for new overwater
OL,11,Fbungalows linked to Sandals Resorts,
OL,12,Ffearing the development could further
OL,13,Freduce public access to the coastline.
OL,15,FOne campaigner told me many locals
OL,16,Ffeel intimidated by the scale of the
OL,17,Fproject.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30810
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785358073
OL,3,C'I need my beach': Why Jamaica's
OL,4,Cbeaches are off-limits to locals
OL,6,F"Some people say we can't fight
OL,7,FSandals because they're so powerful,"
OL,8,Fhe said. "But some of us believe we
OL,9,Fhave to stand up for what our
OL,10,Fancestors fought for and have free
OL,11,Faccess to our country."
OL,13,FBut not everyone agreed there id a
OL,14,Fcrisis.
OL,16,FSome Jamaicans told us the debate had
OL,17,Fbecome exaggerated and argued the
OL,18,Fisland still has beaches people can
OL,19,Fuse if they're willing to travel.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30811
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785358073
OL,3,C'I need my beach': Why Jamaica's
OL,4,Cbeaches are off-limits to locals
OL,6,FOthers said private investment has
OL,7,Fhelped maintain facilities that would
OL,8,Fotherwise fall into disrepair.
OL,10,FOne beach operator, Laura Heron, told
OL,11,FITV News that maintaining public
OL,12,Fbeaches comes at a cost.
OL,14,F"We didn't make this investment not to
OL,15,Fmake money," she said. "Maintaining
OL,16,Fthe property to a high standard is
OL,17,Fcostly."
OL,19,FA series of hurricanes, including
OL,20,FHurricane Melissa, have intensified
OL,21,Fconcerns about Jamaica's coastline.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30812
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785358073
OL,3,C'I need my beach': Why Jamaica's
OL,4,Cbeaches are off-limits to locals
OL,6,FCampaigners fear rebuilding efforts
OL,7,Fand new coastal policies could make
OL,8,Faccess even more difficult in the
OL,9,Ffuture.
OL,11,FThey have raised concerns over the
OL,12,Fgovernment's proposed Beach Access
OL,13,FManagement Policy, arguing it could
OL,14,Fweaken rather than strengthen public
OL,15,Frights to the coastline.
OL,17,FFor many of the people I met, however,
OL,18,Fthe issue went beyond legislation.
OL,20,FAgain and again, conversations
OL,21,Freturned to the same idea: identity.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30813
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785358073
OL,3,C'I need my beach': Why Jamaica's
OL,4,Cbeaches are off-limits to locals
OL,6,FOne resident put it simply: "This is
OL,7,Four birthright," they said.
OL,9,FWhether Jamaica can continue growing
OL,10,Fits tourism industry while protecting
OL,11,Fpublic access to its beaches remains a
OL,12,Fdeeply contested question.
OL,14,FBut after travelling across the island
OL,15,Fand speaking to people on both sides
OL,16,Fof the debate, one thing became clear:
OL,17,FFor many Jamaicans, this isn't just a
OL,18,Ffight over sand. It's a fight over who
OL,19,FJamaica's coastline is really for.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30814
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785358073
OL,3,C'I need my beach': Why Jamaica's
OL,4,Cbeaches are off-limits to locals
OL,6,FWe contacted the Jamaican government
OL,7,Fon multiple occasions to ask for its
OL,8,Fposition on beach access, but received
OL,9,Fno response.
OL,11,FThe government has previously said it
OL,12,Fis committed to enhancing public beach
OL,13,Faccess and investing in more public
OL,14,Fbeaches while promoting sustainable
OL,15,Ftourism development.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30815
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785358073
OL,3,C'I need my beach': Why Jamaica's
OL,4,Cbeaches are off-limits to locals
OL,6,FWhen approached for comment about its
OL,7,Fproposed overwater bungalows, Sandals
OL,8,FResorts referred ITV News to the
OL,9,FJamaica Hotel and Tourist Association
OL,10,F(JHTA), which represents the interests
OL,11,Fof Jamaica's tourism sector.
OL,13,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,14,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,15,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,16,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30816
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785358073
OL,3,C'I need my beach': Why Jamaica's
OL,4,Cbeaches are off-limits to locals
OL,6,FThe JHTA said: "We believe that a
OL,7,Fworld-class tourism product and
OL,8,Fmeaningful public beach access are
OL,9,Fcomplementary national priorities that
OL,10,Fcan and should be advanced together,
OL,11,Fin accordance with applicable
OL,12,Fregulations and policies.
OL,14,F"Achieving this requires a balanced
OL,15,Fapproach that promotes environmental
OL,16,Fstewardship, public safety, the
OL,17,Forderly management of these shared
OL,18,Fspaces, and respect for property
OL,19,Frights.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30817
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785358073
OL,3,C'I need my beach': Why Jamaica's
OL,4,Cbeaches are off-limits to locals
OL,6,F"This should not be framed as tourism
OL,7,Fversus Jamaicans; rather, tourism, our
OL,8,Fcommunities, and our natural
OL,9,Fenvironment are all part of one
OL,10,Finterconnected ecosystem.
OL,12,F"The objective should be to pursue
OL,13,Fsolutions that protect our natural
OL,14,Fassets, respect the rights and
OL,15,Fresponsibilities of all stakeholders,
OL,16,Fsupport local communities, and ensure
OL,17,FJamaica remains a competitive and
OL,18,Fsustainable tourism destination."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
